considered by the Committee and become part of the record.\n\n- Members of the public who wish to speak during this meeting may join the Zoom meeting by accessing the\nZoom app from a computer (downloaded at Zoom.com) or tablet or phone (downloaded in the App Store), by\nentering the following credentials: Meeting ID: 856 1977 8575, Meeting Password: 361369. Members of the public\nwho join the Zoom meeting will not have video, and may request to speak using the following process: After\njoining the Zoom meeting, if you wish to speak, please select the \"raise hand\" option at the lower portion of your\nscreen. The Meeting Host will send you a chat message to identify which item on the agenda you would like to\nspeak on and will unmute your mic at the appropriate time.\n\nAgenda reports and other disclosable public records relating to each agenda item are available on the City's\nwebsite under Meeting Agendas, Minutes & Videos at www.rhe.city/agendas.\n\nEQUESTRIAN COMMITTEE  Page 1\n10/26/2020\nAmericans With Disabilities Act: In compliance with the Americans with Disabilities Act, if you require a disability-related\nmodification or accommodation to attend or participate in this meeting, including auxiliary aids or services, please call the\nCity Clerk's office at (310) 377-1577 at least 48 hours prior to the meeting.\n\fEquestrian Committee  Regular Meeting Agenda  October 26, 2020\n\n1.  CALL TO ORDER\n\n2.  ROLL CALL\n\n3.  APPROVAL OF MINUTES\n\n  A.  EQUESTRIAN COMMITTEE MEETING MINUTES OF AUGUST 24, 2020\n\n  Attachments: Draft Minutes\n\n4.  AUDIENCE ITEMS WRITTEN /ORAL COMMUNICATIONS NOT ON AGENDA\n\n5.  DISCUSSION ITEMS\n\n6.  STAFF ITEMS\n\n  A.  COVID-19 UPDATE (VERBAL REPORT)\n\n  B.  RECOGNITION WALL PROPOSAL\n\n  Attachments: Staff Report\n\n  C.  COVID PROTOCOLS FOR TRAILS USE\n\n  Attachments: Attachment\n\n  D.  PETER WEBER EQUESTRIAN CENTER UPDATE (VERBAL REPORT)\n\n  E.  EQUESTRIAN ISSUES LOG\n\n  Attachments: Equestrian Issues Log\n\n7.  COMMITTEE REPORTS\n\n  A.  ADOPT-A-TRAIL (VERBAL REPORT)\n\n8.  FUTURE AGENDA ITEMS\n\n9.  ADJOURNMENT\n  The next Equestrian Committee meeting will be held on Monday, November 23rd, 2020 at 7:00 p.m.\n\nEQUESTRIAN COMMITTEE  Page 2\n10/26/2020\nAmericans With Disabilities Act: In compliance with the Americans with Disabilities Act, if you require a disability-related\nmodification or accommodation to attend or participate in this meeting, including auxiliary aids or services, please call the\nCity Clerk's office at (310) 377-1577 at least 48 hours prior to the meeting.","minutes_text":"PK\u0003\u0004\u0014\u0000\u0006\u0000\b\u0000\u0000\u0000!\u0000v��z�\u0001\u0000\u0000�\u0007\u0000\u0000\u0013\u0000\b\u0002[Content_Types].xml �\u0004\u0002(�\u0000\u0002\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0